---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Xinyang Wu"
  description="Privacy information for visitor analytics on Xinyang Wu's portfolio."
>
  <main class="section-pad">
    <article class="page-shell max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-medium tracking-normal text-[#202124] sm:text-5xl">
        Visitor analytics
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#5f6368]">
        This portfolio uses MapMyVisitors only after you choose to allow analytics. Xinyang Wu is
        responsible for this website; MapMyVisitors processes visitor data to provide aggregate traffic statistics.
      </p>

      <div class="note-content mt-12">
        <h2>Data processed</h2>
        <p>
          MapMyVisitors processes the visitor IP address to estimate country and city. It also records
          browser and operating system, page URL, referring URL, visit time, and a session identifier.
          Geographic locations are approximate.
        </p>

        <h2>Purpose and provider</h2>
        <p>
          The data is used to understand aggregate page traffic and geographic reach. The analytics
          provider is <a class="text-link" href="https://mapmyvisitors.com/">MapMyVisitors</a>. Its
          <a class="text-link" href="https://mapmyvisitors.com/b/policy">privacy policy</a> describes
          its processing, retention, and security practices.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choice</h2>
        <p>
          The tracker does not load until you select Allow analytics. You can change your choice at any
          time. Declining after analytics has loaded stops future collection after the page reloads.
        </p>
        <p>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-analytics-preferences>
            Open analytics preferences
          </button>
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions or requests concerning analytics data, email
          <a class="text-link" href="mailto:xinyangwuethz@gmail.com">xinyangwuethz@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
